1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,607
这个 repo 有 39 个 commit
This repository has 39 commits,

2
00:00:02,607 --> 00:00:07,232
其中 33 个带着同一条信息：/run-deploy-app
and 33 of them carry the same message: /run-deploy-app.

3
00:00:07,552 --> 00:00:09,152
这句话就是一个按钮
That sentence is a button.

4
00:00:09,408 --> 00:00:13,056
push 到 main 以后，它会重新构建应用，再重新部署一台服务器
Pushed to main, it rebuilds the app and redeploys a server.

5
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,732
有一次，斜杠倒向了另一边
And once, the slash leans the other way.

6
00:00:16,052 --> 00:00:20,063
对工作流来说，那是另一句话，什么都不会运行
To the workflow, that is a different sentence, and nothing runs at all.

7
00:00:20,383 --> 00:00:21,683
就差一个字符
One character.

8
00:00:21,733 --> 00:00:26,000
一句话是怎么部署一台服务器的，一个字符又为什么拦住了它？
How does a sentence deploy a server, and why did one character stop it?

9
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:29,605
到第 2 部分结束时，你会亲手 push 这句话
By the end of part 2, you'll push that sentence yourself.

10
00:00:29,850 --> 00:00:34,991
这是这门课的最后一讲：最终部署与回顾，分三节
This is the course's last lecture: final deployment and review, in three parts.

11
00:00:35,311 --> 00:00:38,479
它的动机是一个好玩的预测网页
Its motivation is a playful prediction web page;

12
00:00:38,479 --> 00:00:41,384
我们的理解是，哪怕是一个玩具级的预测应用
our reading of it: even a toy prediction app

13
00:00:41,384 --> 00:00:45,146
也只有在某个地方跑着、并且保持最新时才有用
is only useful when it runs somewhere, and stays current.

14
00:00:45,383 --> 00:00:48,754
我们录制用的这台机器没有 AWS 账号
This recording machine has no AWS account.

15
00:00:49,074 --> 00:00:51,378
笔记本上的一切都是真实运行的
Everything on the laptop ran for real.

16
00:00:51,698 --> 00:00:56,737
每条和 AWS 打交道的命令，都照 README 写的原样跑了
Every command that talks to AWS ran exactly as the README writes it,

17
00:00:56,737 --> 00:00:58,738
一直跑到它真实的第一个报错
up to its real first error.

18
00:00:59,058 --> 00:01:03,453
控制台、服务器和 GitHub 都是示意图，标着 illustration
The consoles, the server and GitHub are drawings, marked illustration.

19
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:07,539
你需要 Docker、一个你自己的、开通了结算的 AWS 账号
You need Docker, your own AWS account with billing,

20
00:01:07,539 --> 00:01:10,249
第 2 部分还需要一个 GitHub repo
and for part 2, a GitHub repository.

21
00:01:10,569 --> 00:01:13,535
这一讲会让一台服务器一直运行，直到你删掉它
This lecture runs a server until you delete it.

22
00:01:13,855 --> 00:01:15,847
进度条标出 README 的哪一步
The tracker names the README step,

23
00:01:15,847 --> 00:01:18,015
your turn 表示暂停一下，自己跑一遍
and your turn means pause and run it.

24
00:01:19,450 --> 00:01:21,050
这是课上的总图
Here is the lecture's map.

25
00:01:21,285 --> 00:01:23,293
开发团队把代码 commit 到 GitHub
The dev team commits to GitHub,

26
00:01:23,293 --> 00:01:28,346
GitHub Actions 负责构建并部署到云上，用户在那里访问应用
GitHub Actions builds and deploys to the cloud, and users reach the app there.

27
00:01:28,583 --> 00:01:31,997
在它上面，是画成一条链的应用，从数据一直到前端
Above it, the app as one chain, from data to frontend.

28
00:01:32,233 --> 00:01:34,768
课件讲的是 Google Cloud
The slides speak Google Cloud;

29
00:01:34,768 --> 00:01:38,740
我们跟的是 AWS 的 repo，和第 15 讲一样
we follow the AWS repository, as in lecture 15.

30
00:01:39,060 --> 00:01:41,705
现在把同一张总图换成 AWS 的说法
Now the same map in AWS words.

31
00:01:42,025 --> 00:01:45,311
Kubernetes 集群变成了一台 EC2 服务器
The Kubernetes cluster becomes one EC2 server

32
00:01:45,311 --> 00:01:47,209
上面跑着 Docker container
running Docker containers.

33
00:01:47,529 --> 00:01:51,817
image registry 变成了 ECR，里面有三个仓库
The image registry becomes ECR, with three repositories.

34
00:01:52,137 --> 00:01:54,313
Pulumi 变成了 Ansible 的 playbook
Pulumi becomes Ansible playbooks.

35
00:01:54,550 --> 00:01:58,030
服务账号密钥变成了两份密钥
The service account key becomes two secrets:

36
00:01:58,030 --> 00:02:01,035
一个 IAM 访问密钥和一个 EC2 密钥对
an IAM access key and an EC2 key pair.

37
00:02:01,355 --> 00:02:03,769
关键词变成了 /run-deploy-app
The keyword becomes /run-deploy-app,

38
00:02:03,769 --> 00:02:07,926
Ingress 变成了前门的一个 nginx container
and the ingress becomes one nginx container at the front door.

39
00:02:08,167 --> 00:02:10,895
这里没有 Kubernetes，也没有 Pulumi
There's no Kubernetes and no Pulumi here:

40
00:02:10,895 --> 00:02:14,887
一台服务器，由 Ansible 配置好，也没有机器学习那条线
one server, set up by Ansible, and no machine learning lane.

41
00:02:15,133 --> 00:02:17,437
课上列了五件要自动化的事
The lecture lists five things to automate.

42
00:02:17,757 --> 00:02:19,072
对这个 repo 来说
For this repo:

43
00:02:19,072 --> 00:02:23,176
pipeline 的 job 和模型训练，没有，那是第 15 讲的事
pipeline jobs and model training, no, those were lecture 15.

44
00:02:23,496 --> 00:02:27,080
前端和后端的部署，有，而且总是一起
Frontend and backend deployment, yes, always together.

45
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:31,091
构建和 push container，有：三个应用 image
Building and pushing containers, yes: three app images.

46
00:02:31,333 --> 00:02:34,980
课上的计划是：我们已经有了一个部署 container
The lecture's plan: we already have a deployment container,

47
00:02:34,980 --> 00:02:36,773
那就让 GitHub Actions 来运行它
so let GitHub Actions run it.

48
00:02:37,093 --> 00:02:39,215
在这里，它叫 cheese-app-deployment
Here it's called cheese-app-deployment.

49
00:02:39,433 --> 00:02:42,974
课件上说：在那个 container 里调用命令行
The slides say: invoke the command line in that container.

50
00:02:43,294 --> 00:02:45,854
在这里，就是 ansible-playbook 命令
Here, that means ansible-playbook commands.

51
00:02:46,174 --> 00:02:50,847
第 1 部分由你来敲；第 2 部分，它们会作为一长串命令送过来
In part 1 you type them; in part 2, they arrive as one long command.

52
00:02:52,083 --> 00:02:55,880
最开始这几条命令是额外的；README 里没有 clone 这一步
These first commands are extra; the README has no clone step.

53
00:02:56,200 --> 00:02:59,101
只有一个分支，从我们固定版本以来没有变过
One branch, unchanged since we pinned it,

54
00:02:59,101 --> 00:03:01,790
src 里面就是 deployment 目录
and inside src, the deployment folder.

55
00:03:02,033 --> 00:03:05,809
要启用的 API 列表写在一段注释里
The list of APIs to enable sits inside a comment;

56
00:03:05,809 --> 00:03:08,582
在 AWS 上没有什么需要打开的
on AWS there's nothing to switch on.

57
00:03:08,902 --> 00:03:13,404
检查一下：API 调用的是 us-east-1 里的 Bedrock 模型
One check: the API calls Bedrock models in us-east-1,

58
00:03:13,404 --> 00:03:18,246
那是 2024 年选的，所以确认一下你的账号还能用它们
chosen in 2024, so check your account can still use them.

59
00:03:18,483 --> 00:03:23,112
第 2 步，在 IAM 控制台里：用这段 JSON 创建一个策略
Step 2, in the IAM console: create a policy from this JSON.

60
00:03:23,432 --> 00:03:27,282
它允许一次身份检查和九个 ECR 操作
It allows one identity check and nine ECR actions,

61
00:03:27,282 --> 00:03:30,515
用来登录、push 和 pull，对任何资源都适用
to log in, push and pull, on any resource.

62
00:03:31,350 --> 00:03:35,480
把它命名为 CheeseAppECRPolicy，暂停一下，把它创建好
Name it CheeseAppECRPolicy, and pause to create it;

63
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:38,475
一个额外检查表明这段 JSON 能正常解析
an extra check shows the JSON parses.

64
00:03:38,795 --> 00:03:42,592
它不能创建仓库，所以稍后你要手动建三个
It can't create a repository, so you'll make three by hand later.

65
00:03:42,833 --> 00:03:47,057
第 3 步：创建一个用户，deployment-ac215-user
Step 3: create a user, deployment-ac215-user.

66
00:03:47,377 --> 00:03:50,673
给它挂上三个 AWS 托管策略
It gets three policies AWS manages:

67
00:03:50,673 --> 00:03:53,969
S3、EC2 和 Bedrock 的完全访问权限
full access to S3, EC2 and Bedrock.

68
00:03:54,289 --> 00:03:56,422
再加上你自己的 ECR 策略
And your own ECR policy.

69
00:03:56,666 --> 00:04:02,511
第 4 步：为第三方服务创建一个访问密钥，再下载 CSV 文件
Step 4: create an access key for a third party service, and download the CSV file.

70
00:04:02,831 --> 00:04:05,656
把它存进你 clone 旁边的一个 secrets 目录里
Save it in a secrets folder beside your clone,

71
00:04:05,656 --> 00:04:08,357
不是 clone 里面，这样它就永远不会被 commit
not inside it, so it can never be committed.

72
00:04:08,600 --> 00:04:13,635
第 5 步：创建一个 EC2 密钥对，把它的 pem 文件也存到那里
Step 5: create an EC2 key pair, and save its pem file there too.

73
00:04:13,955 --> 00:04:20,248
徽章负责和 AWS 的 API 打交道；钥匙打开你服务器的 SSH 门
The badge talks to the AWS API; the key opens the SSH door of your server.

74
00:04:20,483 --> 00:04:22,574
一个额外检查暴露出一个小出入
An extra check shows a small gap.

75
00:04:22,894 --> 00:04:27,246
README 把密钥对叫作 cheese-app-ac215-key-pair
The README names the key pair cheese-app-ac215-key-pair.

76
00:04:27,566 --> 00:04:32,920
代码要的却是 ac215_2024，三个文件里都是
The code expects ac215_2024, in three files.

77
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:40,174
最省事的修法：就用这个名字，这样文件就是 ac215_2024.pem
Easiest fix: use that name, so the file is ac215_2024.pem.

78
00:04:40,416 --> 00:04:43,317
额外一步：对 pem 文件执行 chmod 400
Extra: chmod 400 on the pem file.

79
00:04:43,637 --> 00:04:47,328
SSH 会拒绝一个别人也能打开的私钥
SSH refuses a private key that others can open.

80
00:04:49,467 --> 00:04:53,136
第 6 步，部署准备，带来一个新工具：Ansible
Step 6, deployment setup, brings a new tool: Ansible.

81
00:04:53,456 --> 00:04:57,360
第 20 讲的 Pulumi，描述的是你想要的基础设施
Pulumi, in lecture 20, described the infrastructure you want.

82
00:04:57,680 --> 00:05:00,123
Ansible 按顺序执行一串 task
Ansible runs an ordered list of tasks

83
00:05:00,123 --> 00:05:02,566
对象是 inventory 里的那些机器
against the machines in an inventory.

84
00:05:02,886 --> 00:05:05,398
它的很多模块描述的是一个状态
Many of its modules describe a state;

85
00:05:05,398 --> 00:05:08,454
这个 repo 也跑了不少 shell 命令
this repo also runs plenty of shell commands.

86
00:05:08,700 --> 00:05:10,577
一个 playbook 就是一串 play
A playbook is a list of plays.

87
00:05:10,897 --> 00:05:13,708
每个 play 写明它的 hosts
Each play names its hosts and holds tasks,

88
00:05:13,708 --> 00:05:15,825
里面装着 task，每个 task 调用一个模块
and each task calls one module.

89
00:05:16,145 --> 00:05:19,162
其中 hosts 这一行决定 task 在哪里运行
The hosts line decides where tasks run:

90
00:05:19,162 --> 00:05:21,947
localhost 表示在你的工具箱容器里
localhost means inside your toolbox;

91
00:05:21,947 --> 00:05:25,042
appserver 表示在服务器上，通过 SSH
appserver means on the server, over SSH.

92
00:05:25,284 --> 00:05:27,780
这就是那个 inventory，写成一个文件
Here is that inventory, as one file.

93
00:05:28,100 --> 00:05:30,959
Ansible 以 ubuntu 用户的身份登录
Ansible logs in as the user ubuntu.

94
00:05:31,279 --> 00:05:34,538
第 4 行指向给 GitHub Actions 用的密钥
Line 4 points at the key for GitHub Actions;

95
00:05:34,538 --> 00:05:38,169
第 7 行被注释掉了，指向你笔记本上的密钥
line 7, commented out, at the key on your laptop.

96
00:05:38,489 --> 00:05:43,374
第 9 到 11 行从环境变量里取你的密钥：什么都不用填
Lines 9 to 11 take your keys from the environment: nothing to type.

97
00:05:43,617 --> 00:05:48,396
然后是这台机器：区域 us-east-1，一个 t2.large 实例
Then the machine: the region, us-east-1, and a t2.large instance.

98
00:05:48,716 --> 00:05:50,934
密钥对的名字，标着 change this
The key pair name, marked change this.

99
00:05:51,254 --> 00:05:55,713
适用于那个区域的一个 Ubuntu 系统映像，还有磁盘的名字和大小
An Ubuntu machine image for that region, and the disk names and sizes.

100
00:05:55,950 --> 00:05:59,107
README 的四个要点指的正是这几行
The README's four bullets point at exactly these lines.

101
00:05:59,427 --> 00:06:03,854
现在改两处：密钥对的名字，除非你的已经对上了
Change two now: the key pair name, unless yours already matches,

102
00:06:03,854 --> 00:06:08,281
还有第 24 行，NextAuth secret，改成你自己的一个随机值
and line 24, the NEXTAUTH_SECRET, to a random value of your own.

103
00:06:08,601 --> 00:06:10,820
第 30 行的 host 稍后再填
The host on line 30 comes later.

104
00:06:13,584 --> 00:06:15,498
每次运行最后都有一个 recap
Every run ends with a recap;

105
00:06:15,498 --> 00:06:18,917
成功的意思是 failed 和 unreachable 都保持为 0
success means failed and unreachable stay at zero.

106
00:06:19,237 --> 00:06:23,205
一个声明式的 task 跑两次，第二次会报 ok
A declarative task run twice reports ok the second time.

107
00:06:25,950 --> 00:06:28,382
第 1 步：进到 deployment 目录
Step 1: go to the deployment folder.

108
00:06:28,702 --> 00:06:32,798
这里有那几个 playbook、inventory 和 docker-shell.sh
Here are the playbooks, the inventory and docker-shell.sh.

109
00:06:33,033 --> 00:06:34,519
打开这个脚本
Open the script.

110
00:06:34,569 --> 00:06:38,430
它把你 CSV 的第二行拆成两个变量
It splits the second line of your CSV into two variables.

111
00:06:38,750 --> 00:06:43,807
第 17 行把作者的账号 ID 写死了，这里是一个占位符
Line 17 hard codes the account ID of the author, a placeholder here.

112
00:06:44,050 --> 00:06:46,023
照 clone 下来的原样运行，它就停了
Run it as cloned, and it stops:

113
00:06:46,023 --> 00:06:47,741
credentials file not found
credentials file not found.

114
00:06:48,061 --> 00:06:53,309
从 deployment 目录往上四个 ../，就到了 /home，多上了一层
Four ../ from the deployment folder end at /home, one level too far.

115
00:06:53,550 --> 00:06:57,817
第 2 步就是这个修复：往上三层，用 sed 或者你的编辑器改
Step 2 is that fix: three levels up, with sed or your editor.

116
00:06:58,137 --> 00:06:59,737
现在文件找到了
Now the file is found.

117
00:07:03,383 --> 00:07:07,735
第 3 步：sh docker-shell.sh，完全照着写的来
Step 3: sh docker-shell.sh, exactly as written.

118
00:07:08,055 --> 00:07:10,818
意外 1，在这台 Ubuntu 笔记本上
Surprise 1, on this Ubuntu laptop:

119
00:07:10,818 --> 00:07:14,882
第 13 行有语法错误，redirection unexpected
a syntax error on line 13, redirection unexpected.

120
00:07:15,117 --> 00:07:19,234
额外说明：在 Ubuntu 上，sh 就是 dash，它没有 here string
Extra: on Ubuntu, sh is dash, which has no here-string (<<<).

121
00:07:19,554 --> 00:07:23,266
而且敲 sh 会跳过第一行，那一行要的是 bash
And typing sh skips the first line, which asks for bash.

122
00:07:23,586 --> 00:07:27,447
在 Mac 上 README 这一行能用；在 Linux 上，换成 bash
On a Mac the README line works; on Linux, use bash instead.

123
00:07:27,683 --> 00:07:33,592
意外 2，录制时，在我们的机器上：构建停在了 15 步里的第 9 步
Surprise 2, at the time of recording, on our machine: the build stops at step 9 of 15.

124
00:07:33,912 --> 00:07:36,615
这里 curl 验证不了 Helm 的下载站点
Curl can't verify the Helm download site,

125
00:07:36,615 --> 00:07:38,329
所以签名密钥没能下载下来
so no signing key arrives.

126
00:07:38,567 --> 00:07:42,067
而且脚本不会停下：set -e 被注释掉了
And the script doesn't stop: set -e is commented out,

127
00:07:42,067 --> 00:07:44,775
所以它会去运行一个根本没构建出来的 image
so it runs an image that was never built.

128
00:07:45,095 --> 00:07:47,868
要看构建输出，不能只看最后一行
Check the build output, not just the last line.

129
00:07:48,117 --> 00:07:50,570
我们的机器不信任那张证书的根证书
Our machine didn't trust that certificate's root.

130
00:07:50,890 --> 00:07:52,419
你的笔记本可能信任
Your laptop may.

131
00:07:52,469 --> 00:07:54,052
没有哪个 playbook 用到 Helm
No playbook uses Helm,

132
00:07:54,052 --> 00:07:58,357
所以删掉这两行和 helm 这个词，工具箱容器就能构建了
so delete these two lines and the word helm, and the toolbox builds.

133
00:08:04,150 --> 00:08:08,225
意外 3：在工具箱容器里，/secrets 是空的
Surprise 3: inside the toolbox, /secrets is empty.

134
00:08:08,545 --> 00:08:13,878
第 26 行也是同样的四个 ../，所以 Docker 挂载了一个空目录
Line 26 has the same four ../, so Docker mounted an empty folder.

135
00:08:14,198 --> 00:08:16,609
提示符里的 ID 每次启动都会变
The prompt ID changes on every start.

136
00:08:16,850 --> 00:08:19,284
所以照第 10 行的样子改第 26 行
So fix line 26 like line 10,

137
00:08:19,284 --> 00:08:22,674
再在第 17 行填上你自己的账号 ID
and put your own account ID on line 17.

138
00:08:22,994 --> 00:08:26,138
运行 aws sts get-caller-identity 就能看到它
aws sts get-caller-identity shows it,

139
00:08:26,138 --> 00:08:27,837
前提是你的密钥能用
once your keys work.

140
00:08:28,083 --> 00:08:31,521
再运行一次 bash docker-shell.sh
Run bash docker-shell.sh again:

141
00:08:31,521 --> 00:08:36,954
两个文件都在，你的叫 ac215_2024.pem
both files are there, yours named ac215_2024.pem,

142
00:08:36,954 --> 00:08:40,392
四个 AWS 变量也都设好了
and four AWS variables are set.

143
00:08:40,712 --> 00:08:42,889
暂停一下，自己走到这个提示符
Pause, and get to this prompt yourself.

144
00:08:45,033 --> 00:08:46,761
工具箱容器是怎么启动的？
How was the toolbox started?

145
00:08:47,081 --> 00:08:49,705
第 36 行挂载了 Docker socket
Line 36 mounts the Docker socket.

146
00:08:50,025 --> 00:08:53,189
然后是 deployment 目录，挂在 /app
Then the deployment folder at /app, your secrets,

147
00:08:53,189 --> 00:08:54,868
再是你的密钥和三个应用目录
and the three app folders.

148
00:08:55,188 --> 00:09:00,009
第 43 到 46 行把你的密钥作为环境变量传进去
Lines 43 to 46 hand in your keys as environment variables.

149
00:09:00,250 --> 00:09:01,523
想一想
A question.

